hadiths[65]{hadithnumber,text}:
"984","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab ham Madina aey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey aur Saad bin Rabee key darmiyaan bhai chaara karaaya. To Saad bin Rabee ne kaha: Beshak main Ansaar mein sab se zyada maal wala hun. To tumharey liye apna aadha maal taqseem karunga. Aur dekh meri donon biwiyon mein se jo tumhey pasand aaey, main tumharey liye us se dastbardaar ho jaaunga. Phir jab wo halaal ho jaey to tum us se nikaah kar lena. Unhon-ne kaha: To Abdur Rahman ne un se kaha: Mujhey uski haajat nahi hai. Kya kooi baazaar hai jis mein tijaarat hoti hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Qainuqaa ka baazaar. Unhon-ne kaha: To Abdur Rahman subah uski taraf gaey aur paneer aur ghee ley kar aey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir musalsal subah jaatey rahey. To zyada der na guzri ke Abdur Rahman aey jabke un par zardi ka nishaan tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne nikaah kar liya? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Aur kaun? Unhon-ne kaha: Ansaar ki aik aurat. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kitna mehar diya? Unhon-ne kaha: Soney ki guthli key wazan ya soney ki guthli. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Waleema karo agarchey bakri se. (Bukhari: 2048). Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Auf Madina aey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey aur Saad bin Rabee Ansaari key darmiyaan bhai chaara karaaya. Aur Saad maal-daar they. To unhon-ne Abdur Rahman se kaha: Main tum se apna maal aadha aadha taqseem karunga aur tumhey nikaah karaaunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah tumhey tumharey ghar walon aur tumharey maal mein barkat dey. Mujhey baazaar dikhaao. To wo wapas na aey yahan tak ke paneer aur ghee zyada paaya. To use apne ghar walon key paas laaey. To ham thodi muddat ya jo Allah ne chaaha thehrey. To wo aey jabke un par zardi ka mail tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Mahyam? Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne Ansaar ki aik aurat se nikaah kya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use kya diya? Unhon-ne kaha: Soney ki guthli ya soney ki guthli key wazan. Aap ne farmaya: Waleema karo agarchey bakri se. (2049). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"985","[AI-translation] Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Halaal waazeh hai aur haraam waazeh hai. Aur un donon key darmiyaan mushtabeh muamlaat hain. Phir jo gunaah mein se use chhorey jo us par mushtabeh hua wo uskey liye zyada chhorney wala hoga jo waazeh hua. Aur jo gunaah mein se us par jurrat karey jis mein wo shak karta hai to qareeb hai ke wo us mein padey jo waazeh hua. Aur gunaah Allah ki himaa hain. Jo hima key gird charaata hai qareeb hai ke wo us mein padey. (Bukhari: 2051)"
"986","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Utba bin Abi Waqqaas ne apne bhai Saad bin Abi Waqqaas ko wasiyat ki thi ke Zamaa ki londi ka beta mujh se hai, to use ley lena. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab Fatah ka saal tha to Saad bin Abi Waqqaas ne use liya aur kaha: Merey bhai ka beta hai, us ne mujhey uskey baarey mein wasiyat ki thi. To Abd bin Zamaa khada hua aur us ne kaha: Mera bhai aur merey waalid ki londi ka beta hai jo uskey bistar par paida hua. To wo donon Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dauday. To Saad ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey bhai ka beta hai, us ne mujhey uskey baarey mein wasiyat ki thi. To Abd bin Zamaa ne kaha: Mera bhai aur merey waalid ki londi ka beta hai jo uskey bistar par paida hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo tumhara hai ae Abd bin Zamaa! Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bachcha bistar waley ka hai aur zinaakaar key liye patthar hai. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Sauda bint Zamaa se farmaya: Us se parda karo, jo Aap ne Usmaan se uski mushabehat dekhi thi. To us ne use na dekha yahan tak ke wo Allah se jaa mila. (Bukhari: 2053)"
"987","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke qaum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak qaum hamaarey paas gosht laati hai, ham nahi jaantey ke unhon-ne us par Allah ka naam liya hai ya nahi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum us par Allah ka naam lo aur use khaao. (Bukhari: 2057)"
"988","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Logon par zamaana aaeyga ke aadmi parwa na karega ke jo us ne liya halaal mein se hai ya haraam mein se. (Bukhari: 2059)"
"989","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib aur Zaid bin Arqam se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein do taajir they. To ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sarraafa key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar haath se haath ho to koi harj nahi hai. Aur agar udhaar ho to durust nahi hai. (Bukhari: 2061)"
"990","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se ijazat maangi aur unhey ijazat na di gai, goya wo mashghool they. To Abu Musa wapas aey. To Umar faarigh huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Kya main ne Abdullah bin Qais ki aawaaz nahi suni? Use ijazat do. Kaha gaya: Wo wapas jaa chukey hain. To unhey bulaaya aur farmaya: Hamein uska hukm diya jaata tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum mujhey us par gawaah laao. To wo Ansaar ki majlis ki taraf gaey aur un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhaari is par gawahi tum mein sab se chhota Abu Saeed Khudri key siwa na dega. To wo Abu Saeed Khudri ko ley kar gaey. To Umar ne kaha: Kya ye mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key muamley mein chhupa raha? Mujhey baazaaron mein len den ne mashghool kar diya, yaani tijaarat key liye nikalna. (Bukhari: 2062)"
"991","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jisko khushi ho ke uskey liye uska rizq kushaada kar diya jaey ya uskey liye uskey nishaan mein takheer ki jaey to use sila rehmi karni chaahiye. (Bukhari: 2067)"
"992","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jau ki roti aur basi charbi ley kar chaley. Aur beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina mein Yahoodi key paas apni zirah girwi rakkhi aur us se apne ghar walon key liye jau liye. Aur beshak main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gehuun ka saa aur na daaney ka saa shaam na karta. Jabke Aap key paas nau biwiyaan hain. (Bukhari: 2069)"
"993","[AI-translation] Miqdaam (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kisi ne kabhi us khaaney se behtar khaana nahi khaaya ke wo apne haath ki kamaai se khaey. Aur beshak Allah key Nabi Dawood (Alaihissalam) apne haath ki kamaai se khaatey they. (Bukhari: 2072)"
"994","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi par rehem farmaaey jo naram ho jab bechey aur jab khareedey aur jab taqaza karey. (Bukhari: 2076)"
"995","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishton ne tum se pehlon mein se aik aadmi ki rooh qabz ki. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum ne bhalai mein se kuchh kya? Us ne kaha: Main apne jawaanon ko hukm karta tha ke wo khushhaal ko mohlat dein aur tangdast se darguzar karein. To Allah ne us se darguzar kya. (Bukhari: 2077)"
"996","[AI-translation] Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khareed-o-farokht karney waley ikhtiyaar rakhtey hain jab tak wo juda na hon. Ya farmaya: Yahan tak ke wo juda hon. Phir agar wo sach bolein aur waazeh karein to unki be mein barkat di jaaeygi. Aur agar wo chhupaein aur jhoot bolein to unki be ki barkat mita di jaaeygi. (Bukhari: 2079)"
"997","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein jama khajoor di jaati thi jo mili juli khajoor hai. Aur ham do saa ko saa key badley bechtey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do saa ko saa key badley nahi aur na do dirham ko dirham key badley. (Bukhari: 2080)"
"998","[AI-translation] Aun bin Abi Juhaifa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne waalid ko dekha ke unhon-ne seenghi lagaanay wala ghulaam khareeda aur uskey seenghi key aalaat todney ka hukm diya. To main ne un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuttey ki qeemat aur khoon ki qeemat se mana kya. Aur godna banaane wali aur banwaane wali se mana kya. Aur sood khaanay waley aur khilaanay waley se, aur tasweer banaane waley par laanat ki. (Bukhari: 2086)"
"999","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qasam saamaan bechti hai aur barkat mitaati hai. (Bukhari: 2087)"
"1000","[AI-translation] Khabbaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main jaahiliyat mein lohaar tha aur mera Aas bin Waael par qarz tha. To main uskey paas taqaza karney aaya. Us ne kaha: Main tumhey na dunga yahan tak ke tum Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka inkaar karo. To main ne kaha: Main inkaar na karunga yahan tak ke Allah tumhey maut dey phir tum uthaey jaao. Us ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro yahan tak ke main marun aur uthaaya jaaun. To mujhey maal aur aulaad di jaaeygi aur main tumhey ada karunga. To naazil hui: (Kya tum ne usey dekha jis ne hamaari aayaton ka inkaar kya aur kaha: Mujhey zaroor maal aur aulaad di jaaeygi. Kya us ne ghaib dekha ya Rehman key paas ahd liya). (Bukhari: 2091)"
"1001","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak darzi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khaaney key liye bulaaya jo us ne banaaya tha. Anas bin Maalik ne kaha: To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath us khaaney ki taraf gaya. To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas roti aur shorba pesh kya jis mein kaddu aur khushk gosht tha. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap pyaaley key gird kaddu talaash kar rahey they. Unhon-ne kaha: To main us din se kaddu pasand karta raha. (Bukhari: 2092)"
"1002","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwe mein tha. To mera oont sust ho gaya aur thak gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas aey aur farmaya: Jaabir? To main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hai? Main ne kaha: Mera oont sust ho gaya hai aur thak gaya hai, to main peechey reh gaya. To Aap utrey aur use apni chhadi se haankney lagey. Phir farmaya: Sawaar ho. To main sawaar hua. To main ne use dekha ke main use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se rokta tha. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne nikaah kar liya? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kunwaari se ya bewa se? Main ne kaha: Balke bewa se. Aap ne farmaya: Kunwaari londi kyun na (ki) jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khey ley? Main ne kaha: Beshak meri behnein hain. To main ne chaaha ke aisi aurat se nikaah karun jo unhey jama rakkhey aur unki kanghi karey aur unki dekhbhaal karey. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak tum aaney waley ho. Phir jab tum aao to samajhdaari samajhdaari (se kaam lo). Phir farmaya: Kya tum apna oont bechtey ho? Main ne kaha: Haan. To Aap ne mujh se use ooqiya key badley khareed liya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujh se pehley tashreef laaey aur main subah aaya. To ham masjid mein aey. To main ne Aap ko masjid key darwaazey par paaya. Aap ne farmaya: Kya abhi aey ho? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To apna oont chhoro aur daakhil ho kar do rakatein padho. To main daakhil hua aur namaz padhi. To Aap ne Bilaal ko hukm diya ke wo usey ooqiya toley. To Bilaal ne merey liye tola aur merey liye taraazu mein badhaa diya. To main chala yahan tak ke peeth mori. To Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye Jaabir ko bulaao. Main ne kaha: Ab Aap mujh par oont wapas karengey. Aur mujhey us se zyada koi naapasand na tha. Aap ne farmaya: Apna oont lo aur tumhaari qeemat hai. (Bukhari: 2097)"
"1003","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne beemaar oont aik aadmi se khareedey jabke us mein uska shareek tha. To uska shareek Ibn Umar key paas aaya aur us ne un se kaha: Beshak merey shareek ne tumhey beemaar oont bechey hain aur wo tumhey nahi pehchaanta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To use haanko. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab wo unhey haankney gaya to us ne kaha: Use chhoro. Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key faisley par raazi hain: Chhoot ki beemaari nahi hai. (Bukhari: 2099)"
"1004","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Taiba ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko seenghi lagaaee. To Aap ne uskey liye khajoor ka saa denay ka hukm diya aur uskey ghar walon ko hukm diya ke uskey mehsool mein takhfeef karein. (Bukhari: 2102)"
"1005","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne seenghi lagwaai aur jis ne seenghi lagaaee use diya. Aur agar wo haraam hota to use na detey. (Bukhari: 2103)"
"1006","[AI-translation] Aisha Ummul Momineen (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne tasweeron wala gadda khareeda. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use dekha to darwaazey par khadey ho gaey aur daakhil na huey. To main ne Aap key chehrey mein naapasandgi pehchaani. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main Allah aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf tauba karti hun. Main ne kya gunaah kya? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is gadday ka kya haal hai? Main ne kaha: Main ne use tumharey liye khareeda hai taake tum us par baitho aur tek lagao. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak in tasweeron waley Qiyaamat key din azaab diye jaaengey. To un se kaha jaaeyga: Jo tum ne paida kya use zinda karo. Aur farmaya: Beshak jis ghar mein tasweerein hon us mein farishtey daakhil nahi hotey. (Bukhari: 2105)"
"1007","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they aur main Umar key sakht oont par tha. To wo mujh par ghaalib aata aur qaum se aagey badh jaata. To Umar use daant-tey aur wapas kartey. Phir wo aagey badhta to Umar use daant-tey aur wapas kartey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umar se farmaya: Use mujhey bech do. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo tumhara hai Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Use mujhey bech do. To us ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key haath bech diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo tumhara hai ae Abdullah bin Umar! Us se jo chaaaho karo. (Bukhari: 2115)"
"1008","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya ke use khareed-o-farokht mein dhoka diya jaata hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab khareed-o-farokht karo to kaho: Dhoka nahi hai. (Bukhari: 2117)"
"1009","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din key hissey mein nikley jabke Aap mujh se baat na kartey they aur na main Aap se baat karta tha yahan tak ke Aap Bani Qainuqaa key baazaar mein aey. To Aap Faatima key ghar key sehan mein baithey. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya wahaan chhota hai, kya wahaan chhota hai? To us ne use kuchh rok liya. To mera khayaal tha ke wo use haar pehnaati hai ya use ghusl deti hai. To wo daudta hua aaya yahan tak ke us ne Aap ko gale lagaa liya aur bosa diya. Aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use mehboob rakkh aur usey mehboob rakkh jo us se mohabbat rakhta hai. (Bukhari: 2122)"
"1010","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lashkar Kaaba par hamla karega. Phir jab wo zameen key khula maidaan mein hongey to unkey awwal aur aakhir ko dhansa diya jaaeyga. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Unkey awwal aur aakhir ko kaisey dhansa diya jaaeyga jabke un mein unkey baazaar waley aur jo un mein se nahi hain hongey? Aap ne farmaya: Unkey awwal aur aakhir ko dhansa diya jaaeyga, phir wo apni niyaton par uthaaey jaaengey. (Bukhari: 2118)"
"1011","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baazaar mein they. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Ae Abul Qaasim! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski taraf mutawajjeh huey. To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne isey bulaaya hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey naam par naam rakkho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakkho. (Bukhari: 2120)"
"1012","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din key hissey mein nikley jabke Aap mujh se baat na kartey they aur na main Aap se baat karta tha yahan tak ke Aap Bani Qainuqaa key baazaar mein aey. To Aap Faatima key ghar key sehan mein baithey. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya wahaan chhota hai, kya wahaan chhota hai? To us ne use kuchh rok liya. To mera khayaal tha ke wo use haar pehnaati hai ya use ghusl deti hai. To wo daudta hua aaya yahan tak ke us ne Aap ko gale lagaa liya aur bosa diya. Aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use mehboob rakkh aur usey mehboob rakkh jo us se mohabbat rakhta hai. (Bukhari: 2122)"
"1013","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein sawaaron se khaana khareedtey they. To Aap un par bhejey jo unhey roktey ke wo use bechein jahaan unhon-ne khareeda tha yahan tak ke use wahaan muntaqil karein jahaan khaana becha jaata hai. (Bukhari: 2123)"
"1014","[AI-translation] Aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke khaana becha jaey jab us ne use khareeda ho yahan tak ke use poora ley. (Bukhari: 2124)"
"1015","[AI-translation] Miqdaam bin Maadi Karib (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apna khaana naapo, tumharey liye barkat di jaaeygi. (Bukhari: 2128)"
"1016","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Ibrahim ne Makkah ko hurmat wala karaar diya aur uskey liye dua ki. Aur main ne Madina ko hurmat wala karaar diya jaisey Ibrahim ne Makkah ko hurmat wala karaar diya. Aur uskey liye uskey mud aur saa mein dua ki jaisey Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ne Makkah key liye dua ki thi. (Bukhari: 2129)"
"1017","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne unhey dekha jo khaana andazey se khareedtey they, unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein maara jaata tha ke wo use bechein yahan tak ke use apne thikaanon tak le jaaein. (Bukhari: 2131)"
"1018","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke aadmi khaana bechey yahan tak ke use poora ley. Ibn Abbas se kaha gaya: Wo kaisey? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo dirham key badley dirham hain jabke khaana moakkhar hai. (Bukhari: 2132)"
"1019","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khabar detey hain, Aap ne farmaya: Sona soney key badley sood hai magar haath se haath. Aur gehuun gehuun key badley sood hai magar haath se haath. Aur khajoor khajoor key badley sood hai magar haath se haath. Aur jau jau key badley sood hai magar haath se haath. (Bukhari: 2134)"
"1020","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke shehri dehaati key liye bechey. Aur dhoka denay key liye boli na badhao. Aur aadmi apne bhai ki be par be na karey. Aur na apne bhai key paighaam par paighaam bhejey. Aur aurat apni behan ki talaaq na maangey taake jo uskey bartan mein hai undel dey. (Bukhari: 2140)"
"1021","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne apna ghulaam apni maut key baad aazaad kya. To wo mohtaaj ho gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use liya aur farmaya: Kaun use mujh se khareedta hai? To use Nuaim bin Abdullah ne itna itna dey kar khareed liya. To Aap ne use usey dey diya. (Bukhari: 2141)"
"1022","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne oontni key pet key bachchey ki be se mana kya. Aur wo be thi jo jaahiliyat waley kartey they. Aadmi oont ko khareedta is par ke oontni janeygi phir jo uskey pet mein hai wo janeyga. (Bukhari: 2143)"
"1023","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Oonton aur bakriyon key than na baandho. Phir jo usey uskey baad khareedey to wo do behtar raayon mein hai usey dohanay key baad: Agar chaahe rakkhey aur agar chaahe wapas kar dey aur khajoor ka saa (dey). (Bukhari: 2148)"
"1024","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab londi zina karey aur uska zina zaahir ho jaey to use kodey maarney chaahiyein aur malaamat na karni chaahiye. Phir agar wo zina karey to use kodey maarney chaahiyein aur malaamat na karni chaahiye. Phir agar wo teesri martaba zina karey to use bech dena chaahiye agarchey baal ki rassi key badley. (Bukhari: 2152)"
"1025","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saawaaron se (aagey jaa kar) na milo. Aur shehri dehaati key liye na bechey. Ibn Abbas se raawi ne kaha: Uska qaul (shehri dehaati key liye na bechey) kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo uska dallaal na baney. (Bukhari: 2158)"
"1026","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi tum mein se kisi ki be par be na karey. Aur saamaan se (aagey jaa kar) na milo yahan tak ke wo baazaar mein utaara jaey. (Bukhari: 2165)"
"1027","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzabana se mana kya. Aur Muzabana khajoor key phal ko khajoor key badley naap kar bechna hai aur munakka ko angoor key badley naap kar. (Bukhari: 2171)"
"1028","[AI-translation] Maalik bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne sau deenaar mein sarraafa talaash kya. To Talha bin Ubaidullah ne mujhey bulaaya aur ham ne aapas mein baat ki yahan tak ke us ne mujh se sarraafa kya. To us ne sona liya aur use apne haath mein pherta raha, phir kaha: Yahan tak ke mera khaazin Ghaaba se aaey. Aur Umar usey sun rahey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum us se juda na ho yahan tak ke us se lo. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona soney key badley sood hai magar haath se haath. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki aur wo guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 2174)"
"1029","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona soney key badley na becho magar baraabar baraabar. Aur chaandi chaandi key badley magar baraabar baraabar. Aur sona chaandi key badley becho aur chaandi sona key badley jaisey chaaaho. (Bukhari: 2175)"
"1030","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona soney key badley na becho magar misaal se misaal. Aur un mein se baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo. Aur chaandi chaandi key badley na becho magar misaal se misaal. Aur un mein se baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo. Aur un mein se ghaaeb ko haazir key badley na becho. (Bukhari: 2177)"
"1031","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Saeed Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Deenaar deenaar key badley aur dirham dirham key badley. To un se kaha gaya: Beshak Ibn Abbas use nahi kehtey. To Abu Saeed ne kaha: Kya tum ne us se poochha? To main ne kaha: Kya tum ne use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ya use Allah ki Kitaab mein paaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Un sab mein se kuchh nahi kehta. Aur tum mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada jaanney waley ho. Lekin mujhey Usaama ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sood sirf udhaar mein hai. (Bukhari: 2178-2179)"
"1032","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib aur Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un donon se sarraafa key baarey mein poochha gaya. To un mein se har aik kehta hai: Ye mujh se behtar hai. To donon kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ko chaandi key badley udhaar bechney se mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 2181)"
"1033","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phal na becho yahan tak ke uski achhaai zaahir ho. Aur phal ko khajoor key badley na becho. (Bukhari: 2183)"
"1034","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phal bechney se mana kya yahan tak ke wo umda ho. Aur us mein se kuchh na becha jaey magar deenaar aur dirham key badley, Araya key siwa. (Bukhari: 2189)"
"1035","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne paanch wasaq ya paanch wasaq se kam mein Araya ki be ki rukhsat di hai. (Bukhari: 2190)"
"1036","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein phal bechtey they. Phir jab log kaat-tey aur unkey taqazey ka waqt aata to khareedne wala kehta: Phal mein Dumaan laga hai. Use maraaz laga hai. Use Qushaam laga hai. Aafatein jinhey wo hujjat banaatey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab Aap key paas us mein jhagda bahut hua: Phir ya to nahi, to be na karo yahan tak ke phal ki achhaai zaahir ho. Goya mashwara jiskey sath ishaara kartey hain unkey bahut jhagdey ki wajah se. (Bukhari: 2193)"
"1037","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke phal becha jaey yahan tak ke wo Shaqeeh ho. Kaha gaya: Aur Shaqeeh kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Surkh aur zard ho aur us mein se khaaya jaey. (Bukhari: 2196)"
"1038","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phal bechney se mana kya yahan tak ke wo Zahw ho. Aap se kaha gaya: Aur Zahw kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yahan tak ke surkh ho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Batao agar Allah phal rokey to tum mein se koi apne bhai ka maal kis se leyga? (Bukhari: 2199)"
"1039","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar par aik aadmi muqarrar kya. To wo Aap key paas umda khajoor ley kar aaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya Khaibar ki tamaam khajoor aisi hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham is mein se saa ko do saa key badley aur do saa ko teen key badley letey hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Jama ko dirham key badley becho, phir dirham key badley umda khareedo. (Bukhari: 2202)"
"1040","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muhaaqala aur Mukhaazara aur Mulaamasa aur Munaabaza aur Muzaabana se mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 2207)"
"1041","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Muawiya ki waalida Hind ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak Abu Sufyan bakheel aadmi hai. To kya mujh par gunaah hai ke main uskey maal mein se chhup kar lun? Aap ne farmaya: Tum aur tumharey betey utna lo jo tumhey dastoor key mutaabiq kaafi ho. (Bukhari: 2211)"
"1042","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har us maal mein Shufa rakha jo taqseem na hua ho. Phir jab hadein waaqe ho jaaein aur raastey badal diye jaaein to Shufa nahi hai. (Bukhari: 2213)"
"1043","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ne Saara key sath hijrat ki. To usey ley kar basti mein daakhil huey jis mein baadshahon mein se baadshah ya jabbaaron mein se jabbaar tha. To kaha gaya: Ibrahim aurat ley kar daakhil hua hai jo auraton mein sab se haseen hai. To us ne uski taraf bheja ke ae Ibrahim! Ye kaun hai jo tumharey sath hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Meri behan. Phir unki taraf wapas aey aur un se kaha: Meri baat ko jhoot na kehna. Beshak main ne unhey khabar di hai ke tum meri behan ho. Aur Allah ki qasam! Zameen par merey aur tumharey siwa momin nahi hai. To us ne use uski taraf bheja. To wo uski taraf uthi. To wo khadi hui aur wuzu kya aur namaz padhi. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar main tujh par aur terey Rasool par imaan laai hun aur apni sharmgaah ko mehfooz rakkha hai magar apne shohar par, to mujh par kaafir ko ghaalib na kar. To wo behosh hua yahan tak ke apne paon se dauda. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar wo marey to kaha jaaeyga: Us ne use qatl kya. To use chhoda gaya. Phir wo uski taraf uthi. To wo khadi hui aur wuzu kya aur namaz padhi aur kehti thi: Ae Allah! Agar main tujh par aur terey Rasool par imaan laai hun aur apni sharmgaah ko mehfooz rakkha hai magar apne shohar par, to mujh par is kaafir ko ghaalib na kar. To wo behosh hua yahan tak ke apne paon se dauda. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar wo marey to kaha jaaeyga: Us ne use qatl kya. To doosri ya teesri mein chhoda gaya. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum ne merey paas shaitaan key siwa nahi bheja hai. Use Ibrahim ki taraf wapas karo aur use Haajira do. To wo Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ki taraf wapas aaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Kya tumhey maloom hai ke Allah ne kaafir ko zaleel kya aur londi khidmat key liye di. (Bukhari: 2217)"
"1044","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Qareeb hai ke tum mein Ibn Maryam insaaf karney wala haakim ban kar utrengay. To saleeb todengey aur khinzeer qatl karengey aur jizya khatm karengey. Aur maal behney lagega yahan tak ke use koi qabool na karega. (Bukhari: 2222)"
"1045","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unkey paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Abu Abbas! Beshak main insaan hun, meri guzraan merey haath ki sanaat se hai. Aur beshak main ye tasweerein banaata hun. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main tumhey sirf wo sunaata hun jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. Main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Jo tasweer banaaey to beshak Allah use azaab dega yahan tak ke wo us mein rooh phoonkey. Aur wo us mein kabhi phoonkney wala nahi hai. To aadmi bahut ghabraaya aur uska chehra zard ho gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum par afsos! Agar tum ne banana hi hai to is darkht par karo, har cheez jo rooh wali nahi hai. (Bukhari: 2225). Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Jab Surah Baqarah ki aakhri aayatein naazil huin to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur farmaya: Sharaab mein tijaarat haraam kar di gai hai. (2226). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1046","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Teen hain jin ka main Qiyaamat key din mukhaalif hunga: Aadmi jis ne merey (naam) par diya phir dhoka diya. Aur aadmi jis ne aazaad ko becha aur uski qeemat khai. Aur aadmi jis ne mazdoor kiraayey par liya aur us se poora (kaam) liya aur use uska ajr na diya. (Bukhari: 2227)"
"1047","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Fatah key saal Makkah mein farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah aur uskey Rasool ne sharaab aur murdaar aur khinzeer aur buton ki be haraam kar di hai. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Bataaiye murdaar ki charbi key baarey mein, beshak us se kashtiyon par roghn kya jaata hai aur khaalon ko tel lagaaya jaata hai aur log us se chiraagh jalaatey hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, wo haraam hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Allah Yahood ko halaak karey! Beshak Allah ne jab unki charbi haraam ki to unhon-ne use pighlaaya, phir use becha aur uski qeemat khai. (Bukhari: 2236)"
"1048","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuttey ki qeemat aur zaaniya key mehar aur kaahin ki mithai se mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 2237). Salam ki kitaab."
